<template><AppLayout><main class="live-analysis"><header class="la-heading"><div><h1>数据分析</h1><p>核查教学覆盖，比较班级差异，再安排有依据的支持。</p></div><div class="la-actions"><button :disabled="loading" @click="load">刷新数据</button><button :disabled="loading||!!error||!!range.error" @click="download">导出当前分析</button><button @click="definitions=true">指标说明</button></div></header><nav class="la-tabs" aria-label="分析工作区"><button v-for="t in tabs" :key="t.key" :aria-pressed="tab===t.key" @click="set({tab:t.key,filter:undefined,page:undefined})">{{t.name}}</button></nav>
<p v-if="loading" role="status">正在读取授权班级、分配及教学报告…</p><section v-else-if="error" role="alert"><p>{{error}}</p><button @click="load">重新加载</button></section><template v-else><section class="la-filters"><details ref="classPicker" class="la-picker" @toggle="prepareClasses" @keydown.esc.prevent="closeClasses"><summary>教学班级<strong>{{selectedClasses.length===1?selectedClasses[0].name:selectedClasses.length+'个班级'}} ⌄</strong></summary><div><input v-model="classSearch" type="search" aria-label="搜索分析班级" placeholder="搜索教学班级"/><p class="la-picker-count" role="status">{{classOptions.length}}项匹配 · 已选{{pendingClasses.filter(id=>classes.some(c=>String(c.id)===id)).length}}个{{tab==='comparison'?'（可选2–4个）':''}}</p><div class="la-picker-options"><label v-for="c in classOptions" :key="c.id" :class="{'is-selected':pendingClasses.includes(String(c.id))}"><input type="checkbox" :checked="pendingClasses.includes(String(c.id))" :disabled="tab==='comparison'&&pendingClasses.length>=4&&!pendingClasses.includes(String(c.id))" @change="toggleClass(c.id)"/>{{c.name}}{{c.archived?' · 已归档':''}}</label><p v-if="!classOptions.length">没有匹配班级</p></div><footer><button @click="pendingClasses=classes.filter(c=>!c.archived).slice(0,tab==='comparison'?4:classes.length).map(c=>String(c.id))">{{tab==='comparison'?'默认班级':'全部未归档班级'}}</button><button :disabled="tab==='comparison'&&(pendingClasses.length<2||pendingClasses.length>4)" @click="applyClasses">应用</button></footer></div></details><SearchChoice :model-value="jobId" label="训练岗位" :options="jobs.map(j=>({value:String(j.id),label:j.name}))" @update:model-value="v=>set({jobId:v,version:undefined,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"/><label>开始日期<input type="date" aria-label="分析开始日期" :value="from" :max="to" @change="set({from:$event.target.value,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"/></label><label>结束日期<input type="date" aria-label="分析结束日期" :value="to" :max="today" @change="set({to:$event.target.value,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"/></label></section><p class="la-scope">{{from}}～{{to}} · {{model.students.length}}名当前成员（跨班去重） · 读取于{{date(snapshot)}} · 仅授权教学训练</p><p v-if="range.error" role="alert">{{range.error}}</p><p v-else-if="!selectedClasses.length" class="la-empty">当前没有所选教学班，请搜索选择班级。</p><template v-else><p v-if="failed" class="la-warning">{{failed}}份报告读取失败。有效训练次数仍保留，受影响的能力及配对暂不判断。<button @click="load">重试读取</button></p>
<section v-if="tab==='ability'||tab==='comparison'||tab==='follow'" class="la-controls"><label>观察维度<select :value="code" aria-label="分析维度" @change="set({abilityCode:$event.target.value,version:undefined,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"><option v-if="!model.modules.length" value="">暂无可用维度</option><option v-for="m in model.modules" :key="m.id" :value="m.id">{{m.name}}</option></select></label><label>用于比较的评价标准<select :value="version" aria-label="分析评价标准" @change="set({version:$event.target.value,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"><option v-if="!model.versions.length" value="">暂无完整评价标准</option><option v-for="(v,i) in model.versions" :key="v.key" :value="v.key">标准{{i+1}} · 目标{{v.target}}分</option></select></label><details><summary>评价标准是什么？</summary><p>同岗位、维度、目标、权重及规则／模型版本才能比较。技术标识：{{chosenVersion?.rule||'暂无'}}；未知标准不混入。矩阵各维度沿用同一套完整评价方案。</p></details></section>
<template v-if="tab==='coverage'"><header class="la-intro"><h2>训练量增加，是否也覆盖了更多学生？</h2><p>当前成员历史回看；次数与人数分别统计，未完整周不能直接与完整周算增幅。</p></header><div class="la-grid"><section class="la-panel"><h3>每周训练次数与参与人数</h3><TeachingAnalyticsTrend :points="model.weekly" :population="model.students.length" @select="openRecords"/></section><section class="la-panel"><h3>本周期学生训练频次</h3><p>四组互斥，合计{{model.students.length}}名当前成员。</p><TeachingAnalyticsRing title="本周期学生训练频次" :items="frequencyChart" @select="b=>openStudents(model.students.filter(frequencies.find(f=>f.key===b.key).test),b.name)"/><p>零次仅表示没有有效教学训练，不代表没有尝试。</p></section></div></template>
<template v-if="tab==='comparison'"><header class="la-intro"><h2>班级差异来自参与、执行，还是能力需求？</h2><p>统一日期、岗位和完整评价方案；执行按分配统计，能力样本不足不补零。</p></header><p v-if="selectedClasses.length<2||selectedClasses.length>4">请选择2–4个班级进行比较。</p><template v-else><div class="la-grid equal"><section class="la-panel"><h3>当前成员训练参与率</h3><div v-for="c in model.comparison" :key="c.id" class="la-class-row"><RouterLink :to="classLink(c.id)">{{c.name}}</RouterLink><div class="la-track"><button :style="{width:percent(c.active,c.n)+'%'}" :aria-label="'核查'+c.name+'参与学生'" @click="openStudents(c.students,c.name+'参与学生')"/></div><span>{{c.n?percent(c.active,c.n).toFixed(1)+'%':'无成员'}}<small>{{c.active}} / {{c.n}}人</small></span></div></section><section class="la-panel"><h3>已到期分配的执行结构</h3><p>截至读取时刻，按最新个人截止计算；历史退出人员的授权分配仍可核查。</p><div v-for="c in model.comparison" :key="c.id" class="la-execution"><b>{{c.name}}</b><div class="la-stack"><button v-for="s in executions.filter(s=>c.due[s.key].length)" :key="s.key" :style="{width:percent(c.due[s.key].length,dueTotal(c.due))+'%',background:s.color}" :aria-label="c.name+s.name" @click="openAssignments(c.due[s.key],c.name+' · '+s.name)">{{c.due[s.key].length}}</button></div><small>按期率{{dueDen(c.due)?percent(c.due.onTime.length,dueDen(c.due)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'}} · 可确认分母{{dueDen(c.due)}} · 时间未知{{c.due.unknown.length}} · 减免{{c.due.exempt.length}} · 结束/归档另列{{c.due.excluded.length}}</small></div><div class="la-legend"><span v-for="s in executions" :key="s.key"><i :style="{background:s.color}"/>{{s.name}}</span></div></section></div><section class="la-panel bottom"><h3>班级参与与执行统计表</h3><p>人数按班内去重，分配按学生与任务关系统计；跨班成员可分别出现在各班，不能相加作为总人数。</p><div class="la-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>教学班级</th><th>当前成员</th><th>参与学生</th><th>参与率</th><th>按期 / 可确认分配</th><th>按期率</th><th>逾期完成</th><th>未完成</th><th>时间未知</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in model.comparison" :key="c.id"><td>{{c.name}}</td><td>{{c.n}}人</td><td>{{c.active}}人</td><td>{{c.n?percent(c.active,c.n).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'}}</td><td>{{c.due.onTime.length}} / {{dueDen(c.due)}}</td><td>{{dueDen(c.due)?percent(c.due.onTime.length,dueDen(c.due)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—'}}</td><td>{{c.due.late.length}}</td><td>{{c.due.unfinished.length}}</td><td>{{c.due.unknown.length}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="la-panel bottom"><h3>班级 × 能力目标差距</h3><p>最近有效评分均值 − 实际目标；至少5名同标准学生才聚合，5–9人标记小样本。</p><div class="la-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>班级</th><th v-for="m in model.modules" :key="m.id">{{m.name}}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in model.classes" :key="c.id"><td><RouterLink :to="classLink(c.id)">{{c.name}}</RouterLink></td><td v-for="m in model.modules" :key="m.id"><button class="la-matrix" @click="openMatrix(c,m)">{{model.matrix(c,m.id).gap==null?'样本不足':signed(model.matrix(c,m.id).gap)+'分'}}<small>{{model.matrix(c,m.id).n}}名可比学生{{model.matrix(c,m.id).n>=5&&model.matrix(c,m.id).n<10?' · 小样本':''}}</small></button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-if="!model.modules.length">暂无授权的完整维度评分。</p></section></template></template>
<template v-if="tab==='ability'"><header class="la-intro"><h2>能力短板在哪里，评分依据是否充分？</h2><p>能力使用截至分析截止的最近维度评分，允许早于开始日期；不将证据缺失解释成能力差。</p></header><div class="la-grid equal"><section class="la-panel"><h3>距实际目标的差距分布</h3><p>{{model.cohort.length}}名可比学生 · 当前均分{{model.mean==null?'暂不聚合':model.mean.toFixed(1)+'分'}}</p><TeachingAnalyticsColumns v-if="model.cohort.length>=5" title="距目标差距分布" :items="gapChart" :selected="filter.slice(4)" @select="g=>set({filter:'gap:'+g.key,page:undefined})"/><p v-else>少于5名可比学生，不展示聚合分布；个人报告仍可核查。</p></section><section class="la-panel"><h3>评分证据覆盖</h3><p>按学生主要状态互斥分类，合计{{model.students.length}}人；已有历史评分与新报告生成状态可同时保留。</p><TeachingAnalyticsRing title="评分证据覆盖" :items="evidenceChart" :selected="filter.slice(6)" @select="s=>set({filter:'state:'+s.key,page:undefined})"/></section></div><section class="la-panel bottom"><h3>训练投入与能力评分的关系</h3><p>横轴为本周期有效次数，纵轴为截至分析截止的最近可比评分；评分可早于开始日期。用于定位投入较多仍低于目标的学生，不估计训练收益。</p><TeachingAnalyticsScatter v-if="model.cohort.length>=5" title="有效训练次数与最近能力评分散点图" :points="abilityPoints" x-label="有效训练次数" y-label="能力评分（分）" :target="chosenVersion?.target" @select="ps=>openStudents(ps.map(p=>p.source),'散点对应学生')"/><p v-else>可比学生不足5人，暂不展示整体关系图；可在下方查看个人依据。</p></section><section class="la-panel bottom"><header class="la-table-heading"><div><h3>当前筛选的学生与依据</h3><p>{{visibleStudents.length}}人 · 每页8人</p></div><button @click="set({filter:undefined,page:undefined})">清除分析筛选</button></header><div class="la-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>学生与班级</th><th>证据状态</th><th>{{moduleName}}</th><th>核查与支持</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="s in pagedStudents" :key="s.id"><td>{{s.name}}<small>{{s.classes.map(c=>c.name).join(' / ')}}</small></td><td>{{evidenceNames[s.state]}}</td><td>{{s.score==null?'—':s.score+' / 目标'+s.target}}<small>{{date(s.latest?.submittedAt)}}</small></td><td><RouterLink v-if="s.latest?.reportId" class="la-button" :to="reportLink(s.latest.reportId)">查看原报告</RouterLink><RouterLink class="la-button" :to="studentLink(s.id)">个人支持档案</RouterLink></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-if="!visibleStudents.length">当前没有匹配学生。</p><footer class="la-actions"><span>第{{safePage}} / {{pages}}页</span><button :disabled="safePage===1" @click="set({page:safePage-1})">上一页</button><button :disabled="safePage===pages" @click="set({page:safePage+1})">下一页</button></footer></section></template>
<template v-if="tab==='follow'"><header class="la-intro"><h2>训练完成后，可比记录发生了什么变化？</h2><p>周期筛选个人完成日期；前记录可早于周期，后记录限定完成后14天且不越过分析截止。</p></header><label class="la-task-select">具体已结束任务<select :value="taskId" aria-label="分析具体任务" @change="set({taskId:$event.target.value,filter:undefined,page:undefined})"><option value="">选择任务</option><option v-for="t in endedTasks" :key="t.id" :value="String(t.id)">{{t.className}} · {{t.title}}</option></select></label><p v-if="!taskId">先选择一项具体任务，不混合多项任务的训练结果。</p><template v-else><p class="la-scope">{{model.candidates.length}}名本周期完成候选 · {{model.pairs.length}}名有效配对 · 完成时间未知另列{{model.unknownCompletion}}条</p><div class="la-grid equal"><section class="la-panel"><h3>同一批学生的训练前后评分</h3><p>{{moduleName}} · 实际任务评价标准 · 配对学生等权</p><template v-if="model.pairs.length>=5"><TeachingAnalyticsScatter title="训练前后能力评分散点图" :points="pairPoints" x-label="训练前评分（分）" y-label="训练后评分（分）" identity @select="openPairPoints"/><p class="la-pair-means">前均分 <b>{{pairMean('beforeScore').toFixed(1)}}</b> · 后均分 <b>{{pairMean('afterScore').toFixed(1)}}</b></p><p>平均差值{{signed(pairMean('afterScore')-pairMean('beforeScore'))}}分{{model.pairs.length<10?' · 小样本':''}}。仅描述变化，不代表任务造成变化。</p></template><p v-else>有效配对不足5人，暂不聚合；下方保留个人依据。</p></section><section class="la-panel"><h3>配对学生分数变化分布</h3><p>按原始差值分组，不将一次变化命名为持续成长。</p><TeachingAnalyticsColumns v-if="model.pairs.length>=5" title="配对学生分数变化分布" :items="deltaChart" :selected="filter.slice(6)" @select="d=>set({filter:'delta:'+d.key})"/><p v-if="model.pairs.length<5">暂不展示整体变化分布。</p></section></div><section class="la-panel bottom"><h3>配对覆盖与核查原因</h3><p>每位候选归入一种主原因；观察中不计作缺后记录。</p><TeachingAnalyticsRing title="配对覆盖与核查原因" :items="pairChart" :selected="filter.slice(5)" @select="s=>set({filter:filter==='pair:'+s.key?undefined:'pair:'+s.key})"/><div class="la-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>学生</th><th>完成时间</th><th>配对状态</th><th>评分变化</th><th>核查</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="p in visiblePairs" :key="p.id"><td>{{p.name}}</td><td>{{date(p.done)}}</td><td>{{pairNames[p.state]}}</td><td>{{p.state==='paired'?p.beforeScore+' → '+p.afterScore+'分':'不计算差值'}}</td><td><RouterLink v-if="p.before?.reportId" class="la-button" :to="reportLink(p.before.reportId)">前报告</RouterLink><RouterLink v-if="p.after?.reportId" class="la-button" :to="reportLink(p.after.reportId)">后报告</RouterLink><RouterLink class="la-button" :to="taskLink(p.assignment)">原分配</RouterLink></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-if="!visiblePairs.length">当前没有匹配候选，可扩大周期或更换任务。</p></section></template></template>
</template></template>
<TeacherDrawer v-if="definitions" modal class="analytics-detail-window analytics-definitions-window" title="分析范围与指标说明" @close="definitions=false"><section class="la-definition"><h3>统计范围</h3><p>当前成员参与使用当前JOINED名单回看，不能还原历史成员人数；任务执行按已发布分配统计。教学岗位不代表学生求职意向。</p></section><section class="la-definition"><h3>有效训练与缺失数据</h3><p>有效训练为READY且有效标记为true或1，以提交时间归周；缺报告不会扣次数。未知值不补零。报告生成完成时间缺失，不能还原某一天已生成的比例。</p></section><section class="la-definition"><h3>任务执行与完成率</h3><p>完成时间为第最低要求次有效提交；最新个人截止优先。时间未知、减免、结束和归档分别列出，完成率不把未知混作未完成。</p></section><section class="la-definition"><h3>能力比较与样本要求</h3><p>同岗位、维度、目标、权重和完整版本才能比较。聚合至少5人，5–9人为小样本。完整14天窗口的配对单独聚合，不作因果判断。</p></section><section class="la-definition"><h3>导出范围</h3><p>导出使用当前工作区的同一统计快照，包含范围和缺失原因；仅导出教师授权数据。</p></section></TeacherDrawer>
<TeacherDrawer v-if="drill" modal class="analytics-detail-window" :title="drill.title" @close="drill=null"><div class="la-detail-context"><p>{{drill.note}}</p><span>{{drill.rows.length}}条记录</span></div><p v-if="!drill.rows.length">当前没有对应记录。</p><article v-for="(r,i) in drill.rows" :key="i" class="la-drill"><b>{{r.name}}</b><p v-if="!r.score">{{r.description}}</p><dl v-else class="la-evidence-values"><div><dt>本次评分</dt><dd>{{r.score.current}}分</dd></div><div><dt>实际目标</dt><dd>{{r.score.target}}分</dd></div></dl><div class="la-detail-links"><RouterLink v-for="l in r.links" :key="l.label" class="la-button" :to="l.to">{{l.label}}</RouterLink></div></article></TeacherDrawer>
<p v-if="exportError" role="alert">{{exportError}}</p>
</main></AppLayout></template>
<script setup>
import {computed,ref,watch} from 'vue'
import {useRoute,useRouter} from 'vue-router'
import AppLayout from '../../components/layout/AppLayout.vue'
import SearchChoice from '../../components/teacher/SearchChoice.vue'
import TeacherDrawer from '../../components/teacher/TeacherDrawer.vue'
import TeachingAnalyticsTrend from '../../components/teacher/TeachingAnalyticsTrend.vue'
import TeachingAnalyticsRing from '../../components/teacher/TeachingAnalyticsRing.vue'
import TeachingAnalyticsColumns from '../../components/teacher/TeachingAnalyticsColumns.vue'
import TeachingAnalyticsScatter from '../../components/teacher/TeachingAnalyticsScatter.vue'
import {teaching} from '../../services/teachingApi.js'
import {analyticsFacts,buildAnalytics,dateRange,dateKey,time,gapGroups,evidenceNames,pairNames} from '../../services/teachingAnalyticsModel.js'
import {csv} from '../../services/analyticsExport.js'
import '../../assets/styles/live-analytics.css'
const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),q=computed(()=>route.query),classes=ref([]),people=ref([]),tasks=ref([]),reports=ref([]),snapshot=ref(Date.now()),loading=ref(false),error=ref(''),failed=ref(0),definitions=ref(false),drill=ref(null),classSearch=ref(''),classPicker=ref(null),pendingClasses=ref([]),exportError=ref('')
